
     ===============================
     📌 Compose BOM Version Rule
     ===============================

     If using:
     implementation platform("androidx.compose:compose-bom:XXXX")

     👉 DO NOT specify versions for Compose libraries.
     The BOM (Bill Of Materials) manages compatible versions automatically.

     ✅ Correct (No version needed):
     implementation "androidx.compose.ui:ui"
     implementation "androidx.compose.material3:material3"
     implementation "androidx.compose.runtime:runtime-livedata"

     ❌ Wrong (Do not manually add version when using BOM):
     implementation "androidx.compose.ui:ui:1.x.x"

     ---------------------------------

     📌 Non-Compose Libraries Rule
     ---------------------------------

     For libraries NOT controlled by Compose BOM,
     you MUST specify version manually.

     Examples:

     implementation "androidx.lifecycle:lifecycle-runtime-ktx:2.6.2"
     implementation "androidx.activity:activity-compose:1.8.2"
     implementation "androidx.core:core-ktx:1.12.0"

     ---------------------------------

     🔥 Simple Rule:
     Compose libraries → NO version (if using BOM)
     Non-Compose libraries → Version required


